sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in Crime No.130/2024 of Sindhanoor Police Station, Raichur district, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 366A and 376N of IPC and Section 6 of Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, 2012, in Special Case No.5396/2024 on the file of the III Additional District &
Sessions Judge and Special Judge, sitting at Sindhanoor, subject to the following conditions:
a) The petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
Shruthinandan Sana vs The State Of Karnataka And Anr on 5 February, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/134579990/
3 NC: 2025:KHC-K:823 c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future;
e) The petitioner shall not leave the jurisdiction of the Trial Court without permission of the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
Sd/-
(S.VISHWAJITH SHETTY) JUDGE SVH CT:PK Shruthinandan Sana vs The State Of Karnataka And Anr on 5 February, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/134579990/
4

